{%- comment -%}
  "Complete the set" card on hoodie and crewneck pages (2026-11-20). Rendered from sections/main-product.liquid for
  product types Hoodie and Sweatshirt. Picks the matching sweatpants from the "sweatpants" collection:
    1. a pair whose design name is in this product's title (Born Ready Hoodie -> Born Ready Sweatpants);
    2. otherwise a pair sharing a collection tag: player two (Side Quest), immortalized (Legends Never Die),
       own lane (Female Lead), brand collection (Elsewhere Signature), urban (Urban Collection).
       Born Ready sweatpants also carry "immortalized" but are only matched by name (rule 1).
    3. no match: a link to the whole Sweatpants collection.
  From 2026-12-18 it mentions the set deal (automatic discount "Hoodie + sweatpants set: 20% off the sweatpants").
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign pants_collection = collections['sweatpants']
  assign match = nil
  for p in pants_collection.products
    assign design = p.title | remove: ' Sweatpants'
    if product.title contains design
      assign match = p
      break
    endif
  endfor
  unless match
    assign keys = 'player two|immortalized|own lane|brand collection|urban' | split: '|'
    for key in keys
      if product.tags contains key
        for p in pants_collection.products
          if p.tags contains key and p.handle != 'born-ready-sweatpants'
            assign match = p
            break
          endif
        endfor
      endif
      if match
        break
      endif
    endfor
  endunless
  assign today = 'now' | date: '%Y%m%d' | plus: 0
-%}
{%- if pants_collection.products_count > 0 -%}
  {%- if match -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      Set add-on (2026-11-20): "Yes, add the matching sweatpants" opens colour + size for the pants and a price summary;
      assets/mw-cart.js then adds the hoodie and the chosen pair together. Phase: sale (to 2026-12-17: Holiday Sale 15%
      off both), set (from 2026-12-18: 20% off the sweatpants), else none.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- liquid
      if today <= 20261217
        assign phase = 'sale'
      elsif today >= 20261218
        assign phase = 'set'
      endif
      assign kind = product.type | downcase | replace: 'sweatshirt', 'crewneck'
    -%}
    <div class="mw-set mw-set--addon" data-set-addon data-for="{{ form_id }}" data-phase="{{ phase }}" data-kind="{{ kind }}"
      data-money="{{ shop.money_format | strip_html | escape }}">
      <script type="application/json" data-set-data>
        {
          "main": { {%- for v in product.variants -%}"{{ v.id }}": {"price": {{ v.price }}, "options": {{ v.options | json }}}{%- unless forloop.last -%},{%- endunless -%}{%- endfor -%} },
          "pants": [ {%- for v in match.variants -%}{"id": {{ v.id }}, "price": {{ v.price }}, "available": {{ v.available | json }}, "color": {{ v.option1 | json }}, "size": {{ v.option2 | json }}}{%- unless forloop.last -%},{%- endunless -%}{%- endfor -%} ]
        }
      </script>
      <label class="mw-set__ask">
        <input type="checkbox" data-set-yes>
        {%- if match.featured_image -%}
          <img class="mw-set__img" src="{{ match.featured_image | image_url: width: 240 }}" alt="{{ match.featured_image.alt | escape }}" width="120" height="120" loading="lazy">
        {%- endif -%}
        <span class="mw-set__text">
          <span class="mw-set__kicker">Complete the set</span>
          <strong class="mw-set__title">Add the matching {{ match.title }}?</strong>
          <span class="mw-set__price">{{ match.price | money }}{% if phase == 'set' %} &middot; 20% off with this {{ kind }}{% endif %}</span>
        </span>
        <span class="mw-set__check" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </label>
      <div class="mw-set__panel" data-set-panel hidden>
        <fieldset class="mw-set__opt">
          <legend class="label">Sweatpants colour</legend>
          <div class="option__values" data-set-colors></div>
        </fieldset>
        <fieldset class="mw-set__opt">
          <legend class="label">Sweatpants size</legend>
          <div class="option__values" data-set-sizes></div>
        </fieldset>
        <dl class="mw-set__sum">
          <div><dt>{{ product.title }}</dt><dd data-set-main-price></dd></div>
          <div><dt>{{ match.title }}</dt><dd data-set-pants-price></dd></div>
          <div class="mw-set__total"><dt>Together</dt><dd data-set-total></dd></div>
        </dl>
        <p class="mw-set__note" data-set-note></p>
        <a class="mw-set__view" href="{{ match.url }}">View the sweatpants &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  {%- else -%}
    <div class="mw-set">
      <a class="mw-set__card mw-set__card--plain" href="{{ pants_collection.url }}">
        <span class="mw-set__text">
          <span class="mw-set__kicker">Complete the set</span>
          <strong class="mw-set__title">Shop matching sweatpants</strong>
          {%- if today >= 20261218 -%}<span class="mw-set__price">20% off sweatpants with any hoodie or crewneck</span>{%- endif -%}
        </span>
        <span class="mw-set__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
